  "description": "HOPJAX01 crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C39 H91 Er5 O14. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er5 (Er) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.299-4.694 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.25-170.11°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Er5O(OPri)13.",
